    "turn_text": "And I wanted to ask you about that too. I know that's not something directly, but still this confirmation of Judge Kavanaugh. It actually really was an emotional debate and it was a great challenge for our government. That's what they say. How do you think this influence what will happen and what is your assessment of what was happening during the last couple of weeks?",
