    "turn_idx": 48,
    "turn_text": "And since you mentioned Staten Island in particular, I want to ask about that because I read that in the 90s, they wanted to succeed from New York. They felt like they don't really fit. And sometimes we feel today that Staten Islanders, they feel like they've been forgotten, even in Manhattan. How do you feel about that? And I was thinking like, this is an interesting thought, you know, about to go apart.",
