        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Immigration reform should prioritize both legal compliance and humanitarian considerations.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker has legitimate authority to advocate for immigration reform based on personal experience and engagement.",
        "confidence": 0.86
